        <mxCell id="l7-box1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3949AB;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11.5;align=center;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Applied Dynamic Reasoning (LLMs / ML / Graphs)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Replace brittle static signatures with semantic reasoning over &lt;b&gt;Corp + Prod RPC/eBPF graphs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Predictive modeling &amp;amp; behavioral baselining of Borg Jobs, SRE actions &amp;amp; TPU workloads&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
